{
    "background_story": "Finn was a charming young lad from the Scottish Highlands. Growing up in a small village, he was always referred to as 'the lass's favorite' due to his exceptional kindness and courtesy towards the women in his life. Finn's mother, a strong-willed and independent woman, had instilled in him a deep respect for the ladies. He would often help the village women with their chores and errands, earning him many a smile and a warm heart. As he grew older, Finn's chivalry only deepened, and he became known throughout the region as a true gentleman. His love for the ladies was matched only by his love for the rugged Highland landscapes, where he would often take long walks, pondering life and dreaming of adventure.",
